OL,3,GNEWSASevere drought declared in parts
OL,4,Aof southern England
OL,5,
OL,6,FA severe drought has been declared
OL,7,Facross parts of the south of England
OL,8,Fafter months of low rainfall.
OL,10,FIt was declared in parts of Cornwall,
OL,11,FDevon, Dorset, Somerset, East Sussex
OL,12,Fand West Sussex.
OL,14,FThe announcement was made by the
OL,15,FEnvironment Agency follows a meeting of
OL,16,Fthe National Drought Group, which
OL,17,Freviewed water resources and drought
OL,18,Fconditions across England.
OL,20,FSupplies have been significantly
OL,21,Fimpacted by high demand during the
OL,22,Fhottest summer on record.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
